  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CECOFA Coffee Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 3664 smallholder farmers of whom 714 are women..Project funds will be used to improve factory facilities; set up bulking facilities: acquire a truck to transport coffee from farmers to the processing facility; and procure tarpaulins to avoid farmers drying coffee on the ground. Some project funds will be used for trainings and provision of technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
